sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as maas-default-gateway<br/>openshift-ingress
    participant Authorino as Kuadrant/Authorino<br/>AuthPolicy Enforcement
    participant API as maas-api<br/>:8443 HTTPS
    participant DB as PostgreSQL<br/>SQL (pgx)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>:6443 TLS 1.2+
    participant Controller as maas-controller<br/>(Operator)
    participant KServe as KServe<br/>InferenceService

    Note over Client,Gateway: External Client Request Flow

    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/models, /v1/subscriptions,<br/>/v1/api-keys, /maas-api/*<br/>via HTTPRoute (maas-api-route)
    Gateway->>Authorino: Enforce AuthPolicy<br/>API Key / TokenReview / OIDC JWT
    Authorino->>K8sAPI: TokenReview validation
    K8sAPI-->>Authorino: Token valid + identity
    Authorino->>Authorino: CEL evaluation<br/>Inject X-MaaS-Username,<br/>X-MaaS-Group,<br/>X-MaaS-Subscription headers
    Authorino-->>Gateway: Authenticated request
    Gateway->>API: Forward to backend<br/>:8443 HTTPS
    API->>DB: Query subscriptions,<br/>API keys, tenant metadata
    DB-->>API: Results
    API-->>Gateway: JSON Response
    Gateway-->>Client: Response

    Note over Client,API: Internal Direct Access (/v1/tenants)

    Client->>API: GET /v1/tenants<br/>(internal ClusterIP only)
    API->>K8sAPI: TokenReview<br/>(5s timeout)
    K8sAPI-->>API: Identity
    API->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview<br/>(5s timeout)
    K8sAPI-->>API: Authorization decision
    API->>DB: Query tenant data
    DB-->>API: Results
    API-->>Client: Response

    Note over Controller,KServe: Controller Reconciliation Flow

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Watch AITenant, MaaSSubscription,<br/>MaaSModelRef, MaaSAuthPolicy,<br/>MaasTenantConfig, ExternalModel CRs
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Resource change events
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update HTTPRoute<br/>(Gateway API)
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update AuthPolicy<br/>(Kuadrant)
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update<br/>TokenRateLimitPolicy
    Controller->>KServe: Watch InferenceService<br/>(conditional)
    KServe-->>Controller: Model availability state
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Update MaaSModelRef status<br/>(reflect model state)

    Note over API,Controller: Webhook Validation

    K8sAPI->>Controller: Admission Review<br/>(AITenant, MaaSAuthPolicy,<br/>MaaSModelRef, MaaSSubscription)
    Controller-->>K8sAPI: Admit / Deny
